<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tosco started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tosco started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said analyst Chris Stavros started coverage of petroleum refiner Tosco Corp Thursday with a rating of hold, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Stamford, Conn., company closed Wednesday at 29-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
